{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md","title":"Fixed Point Characterization","display":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed Point Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-characterization","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-characterization"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed Point Characterization","depends_on":["[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]]","[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-df-modalized-formula]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-characterization — Fixed Point Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a74a9caa29e2a312\" href=\"?note=a74a9caa29e2a312\" title=\"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem\">89-thm-fixed-point-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8f6cb40eba269af\" href=\"?note=d8f6cb40eba269af\" title=\"89-df-modalized-formula\">89-df-modalized-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal{M}_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\,\n\\bigl((B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\,\n\\bigl((B\\leftrightarrow C)\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A, p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A, p)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>只出现在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>下</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(B)\">\\(A(B)\\)</span> : 用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>替换<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span></li>\n<li>模态化公式的不动点在 GL 等价意义下唯一</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target"